    "For greater security after a SUCCESSFUL admin login (with the correct username and password), a 256-bit random key is saved inside a cookie in your web browser. A DIFFERENT 256-bit random key is saved on the app server in temporary session data, along with the result of concatenating the two 256-bit keys together and getting a digest (fingerprint) hash, which is your login authorization.": "为提高安全性，管理员使用正确的用户名和密码登录后，浏览器会在 Cookie 中保存一个 256 位随机密钥；服务器会在临时会话中保存另一个不同的 256 位随机密钥。系统将两个密钥拼接后计算摘要（指纹），用来验证登录身份。",
    "Whenever you visit the Admin Config pages, the app asks your browser for its 256-bit key to prove you are logged in.": "每次访问管理后台时，应用都会读取浏览器中的 256 位密钥，确认您的登录状态。",
