    "Show Appreciation": "支持作者",
    "Return to the top of the page.": "返回页面顶部。",
    "Let me know (anonymously OR otherwise) you enjoy my apps.": "通过匿名或实名反馈，让作者了解您对应用的支持。",
    "Check for upgrades to the latest version here.": "在此查看最新版本。",
    "Show FULL SIZED side bar.": "展开侧边栏。",
