    "This plugin creates a new tool in the User Area \"Tools\" page, for tracking monthly / yearly interest paid on multiple credit accounts (auto / personal loans, mortgages, credit cards, etc).": "此插件会在用户中心的“实用工具”页面添加利息跟踪工具，用于计算多个信贷账户（如车贷、个人贷款、房贷及信用卡）每月和全年的利息支出。",
    "This plugin currently (as of v0.91.00) supports Bitcoin and Solana on-chain stats charts / maps in the user interface, under the plugin menu. In the future (coming soon™), there will be webhook support as well.": "截至 v0.91.00，此插件支持在插件菜单中显示 Bitcoin 和 Solana 的链上统计图表与地图，后续还将增加 Webhook 支持。",
    "Bitcoin does NOT support revealing node TYPE, beyond P2P-related capabilities, so that's the only node-type-related filter we have in the interface (see": "Bitcoin 不提供完整的节点类型信息，只能获取与 P2P 相关的服务能力，因此界面仅支持按这些能力筛选节点类型。详见",
    "Peter Wuille's comment on GitHub": "Peter Wuille 在 GitHub 上的说明",
    "Your Bitcoin RPC service MAY have disabled the \"getmininginfo\" endpoint, which we NEED for mining stats. Consult your Bitcoin RPC Provider on using this endpoint, or try switching to another provider in \"Admin Area => APIs => External APIs => Bitcoin RPC Server\" (": "您的 Bitcoin RPC 服务可能停用了 getmininginfo 接口，而挖矿统计依赖此接口。请向 RPC 服务商咨询，或在“管理后台 → API 接口 → 外部 API → Bitcoin RPC 服务器”中更换服务商（",
    "has a FREE 'Developer' plan, which supports \"getmininginfo\"), to enable the additional Bitcoin stats mentioned.": "提供免费的 Developer 方案，支持 getmininginfo），以启用上述 Bitcoin 统计功能。",
    "ALTERNATIVELY, you can": "您也可以",
    "run your own Bitcoin RPC node": "自行运行 Bitcoin RPC 节点",
    ", and enter it's RPC address in \"Admin Area => APIs => External APIs => Bitcoin RPC Server\".": "，并在“管理后台 → API 接口 → 外部 API → Bitcoin RPC 服务器”中填写其 RPC 地址。",
    "PRO TIP: You can check the app logs in the \"Admin Area => System Monitoring\" section, to see any error messages related to what Bitcoin RPC endpoints have been detected as unavailable. MANY \"free\" crypto RPC providers disable resource-intensive OR important endpoints, to monetize access to them.": "提示：可在“管理后台 → 系统监控”中查看日志，了解哪些 Bitcoin RPC 接口不可用。部分提供免费服务的 RPC 平台会限制高资源消耗或重要接口，将其列为付费功能。",
    "Your Bitcoin RPC service seems to have disabled the \"getnodeaddresses\" endpoint, which we NEED for the Node Count chart, and the Node Geolocation map. Consult your Bitcoin RPC Provider on how to enable this endpoint, or try switching to another provider in \"Admin Area => APIs => External APIs => Bitcoin RPC Server\" (": "您的 Bitcoin RPC 服务似乎停用了 getnodeaddresses 接口，而节点数量图表与节点分布地图依赖此接口。请向服务商咨询启用方式，或在“管理后台 → API 接口 → 外部 API → Bitcoin RPC 服务器”中更换服务商（",
    "has a FREE 'Developer' plan, which supports \"getnodeaddresses\"), to enable the additional Bitcoin stats mentioned.": "提供免费的 Developer 方案，支持 getnodeaddresses），以启用上述 Bitcoin 统计功能。",
    "It may take a few hours or longer to show Bitcoin GeoLocation data, after enabling the On-Chain Stats plugin.": "启用链上统计插件后，Bitcoin 节点地理位置数据可能需要数小时或更久才能显示。",
