    "The \"Custom Start Date\" is OPTIONAL, for choosing a custom date in time for the chart to begin. The Custom Start Date can only go back in time as far back as you have data stored for, as this feature only starts storing data once your app server background task starts saving chart data for the first time. IF you have saved chart backups (in the Backup / Restore admin area), you can restore archived chart data on new installations.": "“自定义开始日期”为选填项，用于指定图表的起始时间。只能选择已有历史数据的日期：应用的后台任务首次运行并保存图表后，才会开始积累数据。如果已在管理后台的“备份与恢复”中保存图表备份，也可在新安装的应用中恢复这些历史数据。",
