    "Did you just install this app?": "刚安装好本应用？",
    "If you would like to bootstrap the demo price chart data (get many months of market value history data already pre-populated),": "如果希望导入演示图表数据，直接查看数月的历史行情，",
    "If you would like to bootstrap the demo price chart data (get many months of market value historical data already pre-populated),": "如果希望导入演示图表数据，直接查看数月的历史行情，",
    "download it from github": "可从 GitHub 下载数据",
    ". Just replace your existing /cache/charts/spot_price_24hr_volume/archival folder with the one inside this download archive, and wait until the next background task runs fully (the app will detect the change and rebuild the [light] time period charts with the new chart data). It may take a few additional cron job / scheduled task runs (a couple hours for slower machines), for a full rebuild of all (light) time period charts.": "。用下载包中的同名文件夹替换现有的 /cache/charts/spot_price_24hr_volume/archival 文件夹，然后等待下一次后台任务完整执行。应用会检测变化，并用新数据重建各时间范围的轻量图表。完整重建可能需要再运行几次定时任务；性能较低的设备可能需要数小时。",
    "One or more charts could not be loaded, make sure price data exists for these markets.": "部分图表未能加载，请确认相应市场已有价格数据。",
    "Charts are only available to show for each asset properly configured in the Admin Config CHARTS AND ALERTS section. Charts (and price alerts) must be": "只有在管理设置的“价格提醒与图表”中正确配置的资产，才能显示图表。图表和价格提醒需要",
    "setup as a cron job or scheduled task on your app server": "在应用服务器上配置 cron 或计划任务",
    "(if you are running the \"Server Edition\"), or": "（适用于服务器版），否则",
    "they will not work": "将无法运行",
    ". The Price Charts page, and chart data caching can be disabled in the Admin Config \"Price Alerts / Charts\" section, if you choose to not setup a cron job.": "。如果不准备配置定时任务，可在管理设置的“价格提醒与图表”中关闭价格图表页面及图表数据缓存。",
    ". The chart's tab / page, and chart data caching can be disabled in the Admin Config \"Price Alerts / Charts\" section, if you choose to not setup a cron job.": "。如果不准备配置定时任务，可在管理设置的“价格提醒与图表”中关闭图表标签页及图表数据缓存。",
    "If you recently installed this app / enabled charts for the first time, OR re-configured your light charts structure, it may take awhile for fully updated charts to appear. \"light charts\" need to be built / re-built from archival chart data, so charts always load quickly regardless of time span...this may take a few days to begin to populate longer time period charts.": "如果刚安装应用、首次启用图表，或调整了轻量图表的结构，完整图表可能需要一段时间才会出现。轻量图表需要根据归档数据生成或重建，以保证各时间范围的加载速度。较长时间范围的图表可能要过几天才开始积累数据。",
    "The administrator has set the": "管理员已将",
    "price charts primary currency market": "价格图表的基准币种市场",
    "(in the Admin Config GENERAL section) to:": "（管理设置的“常规”项）设为：",
    "(enables": "（启用",
