    "!NOT! ALL EXCHANGES SUPPORT ALL CURRENCY PAIRS, double check any setting changes you make (and check the error log at /cache/logs/app_log.log for any reported issues).": "并非所有交易平台都支持全部交易对。修改设置后请仔细核对，并查看 /cache/logs/app_log.log 中是否有报错。",
    "Setting this page as the 'start page' (top left) will save your vertical scroll position during reloads.": "在左上角将此页设为首页后，刷新时会保留页面的滚动位置。",
    "If your web browser freezes on this page for a long time, try selecting fewer charts.": "如果浏览器在此页面长时间卡顿，请减少同时显示的图表数量。",
    "Select Charts": "选择图表",
    "Default Chart Time Period:": "默认图表时间范围：",
    "reload app to apply changes": "刷新应用后生效",
    "*Charts are not activated by default to increase page loading speed / responsiveness. It's recommended to avoid activating too many charts at the same time, to keep your page load times quick.": "*为加快加载并保持操作流畅，图表默认不启用。建议不要同时开启过多图表。",
    "Low Memory Devices Crashing": "内存较小的设备出现崩溃",
    "If your low memory device (Raspberry PI / Pine64 / etc) crashes when you select too many news feeds OR price charts, you may need to restart your device, un-select ALL news feeds / price charts, and then select FEWER news feeds / price charts.": "如果树莓派、Pine64 等内存较小的设备因选择了过多新闻订阅或图表而崩溃，请重启设备，取消全部订阅和图表，再重新选择较少的项目。",
    "ALWAYS BACKUP THE CURRENT SETTINGS FIRST, IN CASE IT DOESN'T WORK.": "请先备份当前设置，以便操作失败时恢复。",
