    "Click to show notices about how charts run within this app.": "点击查看图表的运行方式和使用说明。",
    "Chain data MAY be cached for a few minutes.": "链上数据可能会缓存几分钟。",
    "*CUSTOM* POW mining calculators can be added in the file \"dynamic-config.php\" (in the app's main directory).": "可在应用根目录的 dynamic-config.php 文件中添加自定义 PoW 挖矿计算器。",
    "*Using these mining calculators": "*使用这些挖矿计算器",
    "will set this page as the start page": "会将此页面设为首页",
    ", which you can reset afterwards at top left": "，之后可在左上角重新设置",
    ". If you have portfolio data you don't want to lose, be sure you have enabled \"Use cookies to save data\" on the Settings page before using these mining calculators.": "。为避免丢失资产组合数据，使用挖矿计算器前请先在个人设置中启用“使用 Cookie 保存数据”。",
    "To see the date / time an entry was published, hover over it.": "将鼠标悬停在新闻条目上，可查看发布时间。",
