    "Please select a market to delete.": "请选择要删除的交易市场。",
    "Please leave at least one market, WHEN USING MARKET DELETION MODE. If you which to delete the ENTIRE ASSET, you can go BACK to STEP 2, and choose: Remove ENTIRE ASSET": "删除交易市场时，必须至少保留一个市场。若要删除整个资产，请返回第 2 步，选择“删除整个资产”。",
    "In 'Normal' and 'Medium' admin security modes, editing from the PHP config files will be DISABLED. All app configuration editing will need to be done within this admin interface.": "在“普通”或“中等”安全模式下，PHP 配置文件中的修改不会生效。所有应用设置都需要在管理后台中修改。",
    "High security admin mode requires you to update your app configuration from the PHP config files (config.php in app main directory / plug-conf.php for each plugin in the plugins subdirectory). WARNING: IF YOU SWITCH TO HIGH SECURITY MODE, ANY SETTING CHANGES YOU MADE IN A LOWER SECURITY MODE *WILL BE LOST*!": "在“高”安全模式下，应用设置只能通过 PHP 配置文件修改：应用主目录中的 config.php，以及各插件目录中的 plug-conf.php。注意：切换到此模式后，你在较低安全模式下保存的设置将会丢失！",
    "Turning off 2FA security IS *NOT* RECOMMENDED. Doing so will GREATLY REDUCE PROTECTION FROM HACKERS. IF YOU LOSE YOUR AUTHENTICATOR APP ACCOUNT, YOU MUST *MANUALLY* DELETE THE FILE \"cache/vars/admin_area_2fa.dat\" TO FORCE DISABLING 2FA.": "不建议关闭双重验证（2FA），否则账户的安全防护会明显减弱。若无法使用身份验证器，请手动删除 cache/vars/admin_area_2fa.dat 文件以解除双重验证。",
    "2FA security requires the admin account to enter a SECONDARY \"time-based one-time password\" upon login, which is generated by Google Authenticator / Microsoft Authenticator / Authy / etc. This provides an additional layer of robust security to the admin area, further protecting against unauthorized access and changes.": "启用双重验证（2FA）后，管理员登录时还需输入 Google Authenticator、Microsoft Authenticator、Authy 等身份验证器生成的动态验证码，为管理后台增加一层保护，防止未经授权的访问和修改。",
    "'Strict' 2FA mode not only requires entering your 2FA code upon login, it ALSO requires entering your 2FA code for changing ANYTHING in the admin area.": "在“严格”双重验证模式下，除了登录，修改管理后台中的任何设置也需要输入动态验证码。",
    "Submitting data is not allowed in privacy mode.": "隐私模式下无法提交数据。",
    "You have UN-SAVED setting changes. Are you sure you want to leave this section without saving your changes (using the RED SAVE BUTTON in the menu area)?": "当前设置尚未保存。确定放弃这些修改并离开此页面吗？如需保存，请先点击菜单中的红色保存按钮。",
