    "This app automatically USES CACHED DATA (for a DYNAMIC period of time, based off what type of data is being retrieved from APIs), and auto-determines HOW OFTEN live data can be retrieved (without going over any limits), based on the number of STOCK assets you have added. BUT when SEARCHING for NEW stocks, you RISK using up your DAILY LIMIT FOR LIVE DATA.": "应用会根据 API 数据类型动态设置缓存时间，并按已添加的股票数量控制实时请求频率，以避免超额。但搜索新股票仍可能消耗当日实时数据额度。",
    "Only Search For EXACT MATCHES": "仅显示完全匹配",
    "When searching for assets / pairings, only show results that are an EXACT MATCH to what you are looking for, AND SKIP showing \"similar\" matches. This help a lot with narrowing search results down, especially if you are getting too many results in your searches without it enabled.": "搜索资产或交易对时，仅显示与关键词完全匹配的结果，隐藏相近匹配项。若搜索结果过多，可启用此选项缩小范围。",
